0000DDr 2               ; --- Simultaneous run bonus (SPEC 9.4) ---------------------------------------
0000DDr 2               ;   Indexed by (runs - 1), clamped to 4.    0 200 500 1000 2000
0000DDr 2               MultiBonusLo:
