0000E7r 2               ; --- Level -> reagent probability band (SPEC 5.3) ----------------------------
0000E7r 2               ;   Indexed by (level - 1), clamped to 15. Bands are 1-3, 4-6, 7-9, 10-12, 13+.
0000E7r 2               LevelBand:
0000E7r 2  00 00 00 01    .byte 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4, 4
0000EBr 2  01 01 02 02  
